sdk/php/coverage/
sdk/php/build/

# ── Generated SDK stubs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated stubs for SDKs that ship as their own package (PHP /
# TypeScript) ARE committed so `composer require` / `npm install`
# work without buf being installed on the consumer side. Generated
# stubs for Go / Python / C# stay out — those ecosystems regenerate
# at build time via their respective package-manager hooks.
sdk/python/udb/
sdk/python/**/*.pyi
sdk/csharp/Generated/

# ── Docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/generated/
docs/upgrade_todo.md

